  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "When Manchester City go to Leipzig on the fourth of November, Erling Haaland will be twenty-six years and one hundred and six days old.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "ERLING HAALAND",
        "sub": "RB Leipzig v Man City · 4 Nov 2026",
        "pill": "AGE-MATCH",
        "person": "haaland"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His top-flight league goals by late October: two hundred and fourteen.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "Haaland, top-flight league (to 24 Oct)",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "214",
            "l": "goals"
          },
          {
            "n": "262",
            "l": "games"
          }
        ],
        "person": "haaland"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristiano Ronaldo at exactly that age? May twenty eleven, the day after his forty-goal La Liga season ended.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "ronaldo",
        "label": "26 years, 106 days: 22 May 2011",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His total: one hundred and fifty-three league goals. Haaland's ahead.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "League goals at 26y 106d",
        "left": {
          "person": "haaland",
          "label": "Haaland",
          "value": "214"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "ronaldo",
          "label": "Ronaldo",
          "value": "153"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Robert Lewandowski at that age had just joined Bayern. About one hundred and six top-flight goals.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "lewy",
        "label": "106+ league goals at 26y 106d",
        "mood": "flat"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And Lionel Messi? By October twenty thirteen, more than two hundred and fifteen La Liga goals.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "League goals at 26 years 106 days",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "Lionel Messi",
            "value": "215+",
            "club": "bar",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "Erling Haaland",
            "value": "214",
            "club": "mci",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "Cristiano Ronaldo",
            "value": "153",
            "club": "rma"
          },
          {
            "name": "Robert Lewandowski",
            "value": "106+",
            "club": "bvb"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So by this age, only Messi was ahead of Haaland.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "ONLY MESSI",
        "person": "haaland",
        "color": "yellow"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now match the games. Haaland scores about eight goals every ten league games.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "League goals per 10 games",
        "real": {
          "label": "Haaland",
          "value": "8.2"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Messi (by 2013)",
          "value": "8.7"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Messi, by twenty thirteen: almost nine every ten. Ronaldo and Lewandowski: between five and six.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "Goals per 10 league games",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "8.7",
            "l": "Messi"
          },
          {
            "n": "8.2",
            "l": "Haaland"
          },
          {
            "n": "5.4",
            "l": "Ronaldo"
          },
          {
            "n": "5.6",
            "l": "Lewandowski"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ronaldo and Lewandowski peaked later, and both kept scoring into their thirties.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "LATE BLOOMERS",
        "body": "Ronaldo's 40-goal season came at 26. Lewandowski's best Bundesliga years came at Bayern, after this age."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So can Haaland catch Messi's pace? Tell me in the comments.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "quote",
        "person": "haaland",
        "text": "Two hundred and fourteen. And counting."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more, and play Road to Ballon d'Or at knowitball dot co dot uk.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "cta"
      }
    }
  ]
